# Contacts workstream

This chat/session owns the **Contacts** page in the monday CRM portal.

## Repo

- Work in this repo only: `Documents/Monday/monday`
- Do not touch `crm-prototype` unless the user explicitly asks

## Scope (you own)

- Contacts list, detail panel, profile edit, tags
- Internal notes, filters, toolbar, alphabet index
- Contact ↔ application cross-nav **from the Contacts side**
- Contact-specific services, mappers, and hooks under `src/components/contacts/`, `src/services/contact*.ts`, `useContact*.ts`

## Environment

- `VITE_CONTACTS_BOARD_ID` (live board: `2463183745`)
- `VITE_CONTACTS_WRITABLE`
- `VITE_CONTACT_COL_*` column title overrides

## Out of scope (do not touch unless task explicitly requires it)

- `ApplicationsPage`, `useApplicationsPipeline`, application pipeline components
- `columnMap.ts`, `timelineMap.ts`
- Short-term applications plan work

## Shared files — minimal diffs only

When editing shared infrastructure, change only Contacts-related code:

| File | Contacts-owned areas |
|------|---------------------|
| `src/config/boards.ts` | `canEditContacts()`, `resolveContactsBoardId()` |
| `src/services/crmApi.ts` | contact fetch/write helpers |
| `src/pages/Dashboard.tsx` | cross-nav props from Contacts side |
| `.env.example` | contact vars section |

Do not change Applications write flags or `resolveApplicationsBoardId()` without user approval.

